This template does not choose a license.

The marker in the project file is LicenseRef-UNSET.
That marker is not a license and it grants no rights.
Choose an SPDX license identifier.
Put the license text in LICENSES/.
Set spdx.license_id and spdx.copyright_line.
Replace the SPDX lines in each text file.
Read docs/governance/ADOPTING.md.
